menu "AFE pipeline WakeNet and VAD proof"

config AFE_PIPELINE_ENABLE
    bool "Enable continuous ESP-SR AFE WakeNet and VAD proof"
    default n
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3 && SR_WN_WN9_HIESP
    help
        Run only the Phase 24.2.2 microphone-to-AFE feed/fetch soak proof with
        the packed wn9_hiesp WakeNet model and observational VAD. This does not
        enable Xiaozhi handoff, PTT arbitration, playback suppression, UI
        changes, or an automatic reset/rearm policy.

endmenu
